  <tf.Tensor: shape=(3,), dtype=float32,
  numpy=array([0.09003057, 0.24472848, 0.66524094], dtype=float32)>
  >>> sum(softmax)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(), dtype=float32, numpy=1.0>

